What's happening:
The server sent compressed (gzip) data.
My browser decompresses it automatically.
That's why it looks like gibberish in Wireshark.

The numbers:
5e and a = Chunk sizes (hexadecimal).
5e = 94 bytes in this chunk.
a = 10 bytes in this chunk.
Chunked encoding = Data sent in pieces.
